/-! ## (A) THE NUMERAL — the certified two-sided rational bracket, pinned to 12 significant digits. -/

/-- ★★★ THE NUMERAL (certified two-sided rational bracket): the derived partial-tower endpoint
    `invAlphaZero (completeBandList chargeTraceDepth)` lies in the certified rational bracket
    `[12007329939722/176714586765, 32019546505738/471238898037]` (width `≈ 3.50×10⁻¹¹`). Re-exports
